{"segs": ["PA_ja_144:0.4"], "en": "4. The Naṅguṭṭha Jātaka “O Fire,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_144:1.1"], "en": "though much this is unworthy of you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
